@startuml
actor "Attacker" as Attacker
participant "Node A (Observer)" as NodeA
participant "P2P Mesh" as Mesh
participant "Node B (Subscriber)" as NodeB

Attacker -> NodeA : Malicious Activity
NodeA -> NodeA : Log Event & Hash
NodeA -> NodeA : Sign OBIE Event (Ed25519)
NodeA -> Mesh : GossipSub (obie.v0.ssh)
Mesh -> NodeB : Receive Event
NodeB -> NodeB : Verify Signature & Rep
NodeB -> NodeB : Apply Local Policy
@enduml